.TH MSGGET 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
msgget \- get or create a System V message queue
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/msg.h>
.B int msgget(key_t key, int flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates or obtains a message queue.  Flags include permissions, IPC_CREAT
and IPC_EXCL; IPC_PRIVATE creates a private queue.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the queue identifier, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR msgsnd (3crunch),
.BR msgrcv (3crunch),
.BR msgctl (3crunch),
.BR msgget (2)
